ob filename text source be input ya
exists su name phone movies dir ob text "/storage/emulated/0/Videos/Pyash/" be default ya

su name source filename stage ob name source to name filename source filename be filename do
su name source path stage ob name source filename stage to name text source path be text do

ob text "adb devices" to name text adb devices cmd be text do
su name adb devices stage ob name text adb devices cmd be command do

ob text "adb shell mkdir -p \"" to name text ensure dir cmd be text do
ob name phone movies dir to name ensure dir cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name ensure dir cmd be plus do
su name ensure dir stage ob name text ensure dir cmd be command do

ob text "adb push \"" to name text push cmd be text do
ob name text source path to name push cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name push cmd be plus do
ob name phone movies dir to name push cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name push cmd be plus do
su name push stage ob name text push cmd be command do

ob text "adb shell am broadcast -a android.intent.action.MEDIA_SCANNER_SCAN_FILE -d file://" to name text scan cmd be text do
ob name phone movies dir to name scan cmd be plus do
ob text "$(basename \"" to name scan cmd be plus do
ob name text source path to name scan cmd be plus do
ob text "\")" to name scan cmd be plus do
su name scan stage ob name text scan cmd be command do

su name push stage ob name push stage be write do
